1
00:02:06,045 --> 00:02:06,985
Mind out.

2
00:02:09,295 --> 00:02:10,335
Move!

3
00:02:25,365 --> 00:02:27,625
Look, on the west wall!

4
00:02:28,205 --> 00:02:29,765
Get down to the crypt!

5
00:02:32,965 --> 00:02:33,875
Just hold.

6
00:02:35,375 --> 00:02:36,725
We'll take him.

7
00:02:41,015 --> 00:02:43,455
- Come on, help the lads! - Yes, my lady.

8
00:02:43,455 --> 00:02:46,535
Quickly, now! Quickly! Get those in position.

9
00:02:46,575 --> 00:02:48,775
- Come on. - Close the gate!

10
00:02:49,645 --> 00:02:50,595
That's it.

11
00:05:30,485 --> 00:05:33,945
Oh, for fuck's sake. You took your time.

12
00:07:37,585 --> 00:07:39,065
Do you speak their tongue?

13
00:07:43,215 --> 00:07:44,995
Tell them to lift their swords.

14
00:09:29,585 --> 00:09:31,165
Valar morghulis.

15
00:09:31,215 --> 00:09:32,645
Valar dohaeris.

16
00:09:47,635 --> 00:09:48,755
Open the gate!

17
00:09:48,755 --> 00:09:50,425
Open the gate!

18
00:09:50,425 --> 00:09:51,845
Open the gate!

19
00:10:07,665 --> 00:10:09,535
Come. Come on.

20
00:10:10,455 --> 00:10:11,195
Easy.

21
00:10:38,285 --> 00:10:40,905
There's no need to execute me, Ser Davos.

22
00:10:41,015 --> 00:10:42,765
I'll be dead before the dawn.

23
00:14:26,725 --> 00:14:28,235
The Night King is coming.

24
00:14:30,405 --> 00:14:31,875
The dead are already here.

25
00:15:57,035 --> 00:15:59,335
Stand your ground!

26
00:17:48,145 --> 00:17:49,325
Get down to the crypt.

27
00:17:51,025 --> 00:17:53,115
I'm not abandoning my people.

28
00:17:53,115 --> 00:17:54,375
Take this and go.

29
00:17:58,185 --> 00:18:00,045
I don't know how to use it.

30
00:18:01,075 --> 00:18:02,495
Stick them with the pointy end.

31
00:19:29,625 --> 00:19:30,515
Edd!

32
00:19:31,985 --> 00:19:32,985
Edd!

33
00:19:52,135 --> 00:19:53,535
Sam, get up!

34
00:19:58,605 --> 00:20:00,975
Oh, God. Sam.

35
00:20:04,755 --> 00:20:05,955
Edd!

36
00:21:47,865 --> 00:21:50,655
Fall back! Fall back!

37
00:21:52,835 --> 00:21:54,945
Fall back!

38
00:21:54,945 --> 00:21:55,745
Come on!

39
00:21:57,675 --> 00:21:58,845
Open the gate!

40
00:21:58,855 --> 00:22:00,405
Open the gate!

41
00:22:00,955 --> 00:22:02,075
Let us in!

42
00:22:04,355 --> 00:22:05,625
Open the gate!

43
00:22:05,745 --> 00:22:07,035
Open the gate!

44
00:22:10,035 --> 00:22:11,525
Keep moving!

45
00:22:15,045 --> 00:22:16,175
Come on!

46
00:22:19,705 --> 00:22:22,095
- Keep moving, fast. - To your posts.

47
00:22:22,095 --> 00:22:23,995
- Go! - Keep moving!

48
00:22:26,125 --> 00:22:27,795
Come on, run!

49
00:22:27,805 --> 00:22:29,145
Keep moving!

50
00:23:24,445 --> 00:23:26,175
Dany!

51
00:23:52,675 --> 00:23:54,305
Grab your weapon now!

52
00:23:54,615 --> 00:23:56,325
Guard the barricades!

53
00:23:56,445 --> 00:23:57,695
Through that pass!

54
00:24:00,335 --> 00:24:01,505
Close up the gaps!

55
00:24:01,505 --> 00:24:04,895
Go! Hey! Go! Go!

56
00:24:04,895 --> 00:24:06,725
Get in! Get in!

57
00:24:06,725 --> 00:24:08,775
Get in! Come on!

58
00:24:43,095 --> 00:24:44,005
Move!

59
00:25:19,805 --> 00:25:21,105
- Come on!  - Come on!

60
00:25:21,105 --> 00:25:22,825
-Come on!   - Come on!

61
00:25:24,865 --> 00:25:26,285
Protect the gate!

62
00:25:26,315 --> 00:25:27,925
Protect the gate!

63
00:25:28,385 --> 00:25:30,675
They're coming! Come on!

64
00:25:30,915 --> 00:25:32,025
Fall back!

65
00:25:52,705 --> 00:25:53,985
Light the trench!

66
00:25:54,155 --> 00:25:55,475
Light the trench!

67
00:25:57,225 --> 00:25:59,205
- Wait!  - Light the trench!

68
00:26:28,775 --> 00:26:29,985
She can't see us.

69
00:26:31,765 --> 00:26:33,225
Light the trenches!

70
00:26:47,765 --> 00:26:49,545
With a torch, light the trenches!

71
00:26:49,565 --> 00:26:51,605
- Right there.  - Torch it!

72
00:26:53,445 --> 00:26:54,865
Light the trenches!

73
00:29:39,385 --> 00:29:40,145
Clegane.

74
00:29:46,845 --> 00:29:49,415
You must try not to worry yourself.

75
00:29:58,885 --> 00:30:08,885
分析，谁会活到最后？
上知乎搜索「权游谁会死」，给出你的神预测

76
00:30:02,485 --> 00:30:04,455
At least we're already in a crypt.

77
00:30:09,515 --> 00:30:10,765
If we were up there,

78
00:30:11,775 --> 00:30:14,605
we might see something everyone else is missing.

79
00:30:16,785 --> 00:30:18,785
Something that makes a difference.

80
00:30:20,155 --> 00:30:20,845
What?

81
00:30:21,665 --> 00:30:22,935
Remember the Battle of Blackwater?

82
00:30:22,935 --> 00:30:24,085
I brought us through the Mud Gate.

83
00:30:24,085 --> 00:30:25,645
And got your face cut in half.

84
00:30:25,655 --> 00:30:27,295
And it made a difference.

85
00:30:29,975 --> 00:30:31,435
If I was out there right now...

86
00:30:31,435 --> 00:30:32,465
You'd die.

87
00:30:35,265 --> 00:30:36,505
There's nothing you can do.

88
00:30:41,115 --> 00:30:43,325
You might be surprised at the lengths I'd go

89
00:30:43,325 --> 00:30:45,815
to avoid joining the Army of the Dead.

90
00:30:45,885 --> 00:30:49,085
I could think of no organization less suited to my talents.

91
00:30:49,085 --> 00:30:51,165
Witty remarks won't make a difference.

92
00:30:54,075 --> 00:30:56,395
That's why we're down here, none of us can do anything.

93
00:30:58,725 --> 00:30:59,665
It's the truth.

94
00:31:01,135 --> 00:31:03,175
It's the most heroic thing we can do now...

95
00:31:05,315 --> 00:31:06,885
look the truth in the face.

96
00:31:12,355 --> 00:31:14,105
Maybe we should have stayed married.

97
00:31:14,895 --> 00:31:16,315
You were the best of them.

98
00:31:17,765 --> 00:31:20,255
What a terrifying thought.

99
00:31:26,995 --> 00:31:28,595
It wouldn't work between us.

100
00:31:29,665 --> 00:31:30,375
Why not?

101
00:31:31,515 --> 00:31:32,715
The Dragon Queen.

102
00:31:35,035 --> 00:31:37,655
Your divided loyalties would become a problem.

103
00:31:39,265 --> 00:31:40,125
Yes.

104
00:31:41,295 --> 00:31:43,895
Without the Dragon Queen, there'd be no problem at all.

105
00:31:45,115 --> 00:31:46,435
We'd all be dead already.

106
00:32:08,485 --> 00:32:09,745
They lit the trench.

107
00:32:23,985 --> 00:32:24,665
Bran...

108
00:32:30,475 --> 00:32:31,765
I just want you to know...

109
00:32:36,385 --> 00:32:37,195
I wish--

110
00:32:38,975 --> 00:32:40,005
The things I did--

111
00:32:40,005 --> 00:32:42,635
Everything you did brought you where you are now.

112
00:32:45,165 --> 00:32:46,175
Where you belong.

113
00:32:48,735 --> 00:32:49,455
Home.

114
00:33:00,845 --> 00:33:02,105
I'm going to go now.

115
00:33:05,455 --> 00:33:06,225
Go where?

116
00:34:55,355 --> 00:34:56,555
Man the walls!

117
00:34:57,705 --> 00:34:59,335
Man the walls!

118
00:35:07,435 --> 00:35:08,955
Man the wall!

119
00:35:09,635 --> 00:35:11,505
Man the walls!

120
00:35:13,205 --> 00:35:14,135
Come on!

121
00:35:14,985 --> 00:35:17,185
Get out there! Get moving!

122
00:35:17,945 --> 00:35:20,625
Come on. Come on! Come on!

123
00:35:23,485 --> 00:35:25,265
Go, go, go!

124
00:35:25,835 --> 00:35:26,855
Come on!

125
00:36:06,885 --> 00:36:08,835
They're against the wall!

126
00:36:12,885 --> 00:36:14,665
Get more men up here!

127
00:36:19,375 --> 00:36:21,205
- Fill the gaps, quickly! - Get in there!

128
00:36:21,205 --> 00:36:22,765
They're climbing the walls!

129
00:36:22,765 --> 00:36:25,415
- Relieve the archers! - Relieve the archers!

130
00:36:27,415 --> 00:36:28,985
Archers on top!

131
00:36:28,985 --> 00:36:31,835
- Move up! - Go, go! Come here!

132
00:36:31,835 --> 00:36:33,315
- Come on! - Move back!

133
00:36:33,315 --> 00:36:35,285
- Stand away! - Go on, go on. Go! Go.

134
00:36:35,285 --> 00:36:38,085
- Step back. - All the way, archers!

135
00:36:53,895 --> 00:36:54,865
Hold the wall!

136
00:36:54,865 --> 00:36:56,725
The wall, they're coming up!

137
00:36:56,795 --> 00:36:59,845
- Hold the wall! - Hold the wall!

138
00:36:59,845 --> 00:37:00,965
Draw!

139
00:37:25,725 --> 00:37:26,755
Come on!

140
00:38:17,935 --> 00:38:19,115
They're coming up!

141
00:38:31,245 --> 00:38:32,345
Look out!

142
00:40:11,755 --> 00:40:12,965
Clegane!

143
00:40:14,315 --> 00:40:15,425
Clegane!

144
00:41:25,865 --> 00:41:26,935
Clegane!

145
00:41:27,865 --> 00:41:29,375
Clegane, we need you!

146
00:41:30,485 --> 00:41:31,545
You can't give up on us.

147
00:41:31,555 --> 00:41:33,895
Fuck off! We can't beat them.

148
00:41:33,935 --> 00:41:36,055
Don't you see that, you stupid whore?

149
00:41:36,355 --> 00:41:37,735
We're fighting Death!

150
00:41:38,065 --> 00:41:39,545
They can't beat Death.

151
00:41:44,545 --> 00:41:45,725
Tell her that.

152
00:49:24,555 --> 00:49:25,765
Open the door!

153
00:49:26,115 --> 00:49:26,925
Open the door!

154
00:49:26,925 --> 00:49:28,655
- Come on! - Open the door!

155
00:49:28,945 --> 00:49:29,535
Open the door!

156
00:49:29,545 --> 00:49:30,595
Please!

157
00:49:31,655 --> 00:49:32,695
Open it!

158
00:51:11,495 --> 00:51:13,885
Come on! Go!

159
00:51:14,195 --> 00:51:17,305
- Come on! - Run!

160
00:51:43,205 --> 00:51:44,305
We've gotta go!

161
00:52:46,115 --> 00:52:48,345
The Lord brought him back for a purpose.

162
00:52:53,355 --> 00:52:55,605
Now that purpose has been served.

163
00:53:00,915 --> 00:53:01,955
I know you.

164
00:53:07,605 --> 00:53:08,705
And I know you.

165
00:53:16,585 --> 00:53:17,945
You said we'd meet again.

166
00:53:19,005 --> 00:53:20,175
And here we are.

167
00:53:21,225 --> 00:53:22,485
At the end of the world.

168
00:53:24,765 --> 00:53:26,565
You said I'd shut many eyes forever.

169
00:53:28,295 --> 00:53:29,865
You were right about that too.

170
00:53:30,925 --> 00:53:32,065
Brown eyes...

171
00:53:32,835 --> 00:53:33,935
green eyes...

172
00:53:36,385 --> 00:53:37,535
and blue eyes.

173
00:53:57,365 --> 00:53:59,725
What do we say to the God of Death?

174
00:54:04,095 --> 00:54:05,115
Not today.

175
00:54:30,715 --> 00:54:31,855
Here they come!

176
00:54:35,635 --> 00:54:36,765
Steady, lads.

177
00:54:37,875 --> 00:54:38,915
Steady now.

178
00:54:41,845 --> 00:54:43,335
Make every shot count.

179
00:54:52,485 --> 00:54:53,505
Over there!

180
00:54:56,955 --> 00:54:57,905
There!

181
00:55:38,935 --> 00:55:39,895
Get off.

182
00:57:17,095 --> 00:57:18,405
Dracarys.

183
01:02:01,985 --> 01:02:03,245
Come on! Come on!

184
01:02:05,515 --> 01:02:08,255
No! No, no, no!

185
01:02:57,935 --> 01:02:59,965
- Bran! - Go!

186
01:08:17,865 --> 01:08:18,935
Jorah!

187
01:11:04,705 --> 01:11:05,665
Theon.

188
01:11:17,675 --> 01:11:18,895
You're a good man.

189
01:11:25,245 --> 01:11:26,255
Thank you.

190
01:16:50,275 --> 01:16:51,295
I'm hurt.

